  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Dark sphere, War sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you create a totem, you may spend a spell point to add the effects of a darkness ability you have to it. If you do, the entire area of your totem is a darkness, and your melds work within this totem as if they were within any other darkness that you created.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/dark#toc81\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
